WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.568
-JoJo, you're a great dancer,

00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:04.070
so I wanted to challenge
you to a dance-off.

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.972
-Okay, fair enough.
-But I don't want to know

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:07.373
who can dance the best.

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:09.074
I want to know
who can dance the hardest.

00:00:09.074 --> 00:00:11.377
-Okay, I like it.
-It's time for a "Tonight Show"

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:12.579
Aggressive Dance-off!
Here we go.

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:13.847
-Let's do it!
-Okay.

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.414
-♪ Aggressive ♪
-♪ Aggressive! ♪

00:00:15.414 --> 00:00:19.118
-♪ Da-ance-off ♪
-♪ Da-ance! Yeah! ♪

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:20.720
-Now, here's how
it's going to work.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.455
We'll be given a series of dance
moves,

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:23.623
then we'll have to do
each of them

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:25.224
as aggressively as possible.

00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:27.861
When you hear a ding, you have
to move on to the next dance.

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.262
-Okay.
-I will go first.

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:30.530
JoJo, you better stand
over there

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:31.798
because things
are about to get intense.

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:32.932
-All right, good luck,
good luck!

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.034
-Thank you.
Yeah, I don't even need it.

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:37.370
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, wow. Okay.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.871
-I'm getting into character now.

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:40.439
-Okay, sounds good.

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:42.141
-Roots, can I get a beat?

00:00:42.141 --> 00:00:43.810
♪♪

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.111
[ Ding! ]

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:47.346
-Let's see it!

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:49.081
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:49.081 --> 00:00:52.285
All right!

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:54.854
[ Ding! ]

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:56.556
Oh, whoa!

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:59.926
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:03.096
[ Ding! ]

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:05.498
That's it! Go! Go!

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:06.499
Whoa!

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.001
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:10.336
[ Ding! Ding! Ding! Ding! ]

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:11.971
-What's up?

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:14.040
-Good job. Good job.
That was good.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:15.608
-Thanks.
-That was good.

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:17.477
-Whew!

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:20.680
-Feeling good? Can you breathe?
-Grandpa needs a nap.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.615
-Can I get an oxygen tank
on set?!

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:24.550
-All right, JoJo, you're up.
-Okay.

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:26.686
-[ Sighs ] Roots, give her
a beat when you're ready.

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:28.420
♪♪

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.591
-Oh, yeah. All right!

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:35.561
[ cheers and applause ]

00:01:35.561 --> 00:01:36.629
[ Ding! ]
-That was good actually.

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:38.498
-What do I have to do?
Oh, yes!

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:42.135
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:43.769
-That's aggressive! Oh!

00:01:43.769 --> 00:01:45.337
That's aggressive!
[ Ding! ]

00:01:45.337 --> 00:01:47.740
-Ohh! Let's go!

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:50.776
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:50.776 --> 00:01:52.211
[ Laughs ]
[ Ding! Ding! Ding! Ding! ]

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:54.881
-Oh, my God. [ Laughs ]

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:56.282
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:58.284
Not bad.
-Wow!

00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:00.252
-Not too shabby.
-Thank you.

00:02:00.252 --> 00:02:02.021
-You can dance.
-This time, I can.

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:04.524
-Oh, gosh.
That was pretty good,

00:02:04.524 --> 00:02:06.692
but there's only one way to find
out who is the most aggressive

00:02:06.692 --> 00:02:08.861
dancer by going head to head.

00:02:08.861 --> 00:02:11.731
For the final round, we'll be
dancing at the same time.

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:14.133
-Okay.
Should we take a breather?

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:15.968
-I definitely need one,
but it's okay.

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:18.037
You ready for this?
-Let's do it!

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:18.938
-Let's do it. Roots?

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:20.673
♪♪

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:22.675
[ Ding! ]

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:27.914
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:27.914 --> 00:02:29.148
[ Ding! ]

00:02:29.148 --> 00:02:31.484
-Doing good.

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:35.420
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:36.489
[ Ding! ]
-Jimmy!

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:39.392
-Sorry. Sorry.
-Okay.

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:42.662
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:45.431
♪♪

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:47.734
How was that?

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:49.635
[ Ding! Ding! Ding! Ding! ]

00:02:49.635 --> 00:02:51.037
-We have a winner.

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:52.372
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:52.372 --> 00:02:55.775
It's JoJo Siwa, everybody,
the champ!

